<title>BELGIUM: Belgian OLO exchange auction totals 11.75 bln bfr.</title>
<headline>Belgian OLO exchange auction totals 11.75 bln bfr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury said its linear government bond (OLO) exchange auction totalled 11.75 billion Belgian francs.</p>
<p> OLOs offered *		 amount of new OLOs sold (in bln bfr)</p>
<p> code 264 7.00% (1999)	 zero</p>
<p> code 285 5.00% (2001)	 zero</p>
<p> code 259 8.75% (2002)	 3.40</p>
<p> code 273 6.50% (2005)	 3.45</p>
<p> code 286 6.25% (2007)	 4.90</p>
<p>NOTE - * in exchange for 11.82 bln bfr of OLO (code) 248.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
